spans.s:
vi-phala, a. bearing no fruit (tree);
 🞄fruitless, futile, vain;
 disappointed: -tā, f., 🞄-tva, n. fruitlessness, uselessness;
 -preraṇa, 🞄a. flung in vain;
 -phala-ya, den. P. render 🞄fruitless, not allow any one (g.), to (inf.);
 🞄-phala-śrama, a. exerting oneself in vain: 🞄-tva, n. useless exertion;
 -phalī-kṛ, render 🞄useless, thwart;
 -phalī-bhaviṣṇu, a. becoming 🞄useless;
 -phalī-bhū, become useless.
